# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🦍 Cerberus AI — MCP MongoDB Server Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values:
#   cp .env.example .env
# NEVER commit .env files with real credentials.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── MongoDB Atlas Connection ─────────────────────────────────
# Format: mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/?retryWrites=true&w=majority
# Free tier available at: https://www.mongodb.com/atlas/database
MONGODB_URI=YOUR_MONGODB_ATLAS_URI_HERE
MONGODB_DATABASE=gorilla_agents

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ⚠️  JUDGES — QUICK SETUP NOTE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This MCP server only needs a MongoDB Atlas connection string.
#
# For Gemini AI configuration (API key / Vertex AI), see:
#   • sandbox/.env.example        (root sandbox config — loaded by start-services.js)
#   • sandbox/hono-api/.env.example (Hono API config)
#
# You can plug EITHER a free Google AI Studio API key OR a Vertex AI
# project ID — the app works fine with both. We RECOMMEND using an
# AI Studio key because gemini-3-flash-preview on Vertex AI requires
# GCP_LOCATION=global, which can return 404 errors during preview
# phases for some billing accounts.
#
# Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
